NOTE ON DICTIONARY DATA
=======================

The MIT licence above covers the SOURCE CODE of this project only.

It does NOT cover the dictionary data, or any database file built from it.
That data comes from third-party projects released under share-alike terms,
and those terms follow the data into any derivative work, including the
SQLite databases this project generates:

  - JMdict     (Japanese-English)   CC BY-SA 3.0
                                     Electronic Dictionary Research and
                                     Development Group (EDRDG)
                                     https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html

  - CC-CEDICT  (Chinese-English)    CC BY-SA 4.0
                                     https://cc-cedict.org/

  - KANJIDIC2  (Kanji database)     CC BY-SA 3.0
                                     EDRDG, as above

If you redistribute a database built by this project, or any work derived
from one, you must attribute the sources above and license that database
under the same CC BY-SA terms. See DATA-LICENSES.md for detail.
